<description>&lt;p&gt;Israel has intensified airstrikes and artillery against Hezbollah sites in Lebanon, including a deep strike on a Hezbollah stronghold, while Hezbollah is shifting to guerrilla tactics and drone warfare ahead of a possible Israeli incursion. Lebanese authorities have charged five Hezbollah members with recruiting and arming others and imposed sanctions on a charity and gold companies linked to the group. Iraq reached a compromise with a powerful pro-Iran militia to prevent a clash, according to officials. The conflict caused 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxNV0F3Y1JvLW9wV3hKdTF6Vl93cEtyamFFWlJ6eFBMYjFpZW5jNERvNEFya1BOakpvOTZ5UFcxbzhOODlGTjBmV2tXX3U5MHd5QTRPOEt2UzM3bGZlUGNnVmNnTWJKS2lER3pGSzBrM3p2NUoxSGlTUmIwUnlaV3QwRW5kVmZzQU1vb3czckVoalV2RnlyNjFNZE1PcnhHOERabU40?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxQcWJ4Q2toZ0ZreHU4QmNoX0Z3dlVSMkdxY0N4bFR3LU9VYVEyNHlpR2tFNHdDaG45YTNtdUFRampkMVVPNWNYU01udms4ZXAwX1BTWXEwZ1Y0Y21QSi1oc2hqdFNpeUh6ZmxYS3g1aGlpOHBOcXNfSVVOZzBIRDVYcWFB?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTFBWX1I5VDVxdENudGRHMno0RkNQbnlIRTdwaVRLMlRQc2h2ajhsTzVIdTdoNXpLMmJFNHRwY2hmajFTdEticzdxNU1MQ2laaEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;MTV Lebanon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxQazRtRkFjS0o2TE1aRksyYnFZa09sQnBiUTZhMVJiNFNYQWtQb0JJQ285SDFKcHV1X0FRdmFVSmxaVzlFU3kwVG5vTFpoQmtCcWVJZXhwTkZ0WldrWWxmODFOMUZPSVUzTkZhRzBuV1F6WlRoaW9kU3BCdUNTSjl